    "body": "> The right architecture here should be that step 13 in the processing model should relativize and coarsen now based on document's relevant global object. It's an easy fix.\r\n\r\nIn that case we should do the same in step 14 for IntersectionObserver (or raise an issue with them), since that has the same relativeness issue.",
